<title>USA: Playtex Products to sell $150 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Playtex Products to sell $150 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Playtex Products Inc will sell $150 million in senior notes due 2004 in a 144a private placement offering, according to a confidential prospectus.</p>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp is listed as sole manager for the deal.  </p>
<p>Playtex, based in Westport, Conn., manufactures and distributes a wide variety of personal care products.</p>
<p>A company official declined to comment.</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
